<div class="project__info">
  <div class="project__info-L">
    <p class="big">
      In 2018, Impact Gaming housed its H1Z1 Pro League team in Las Vegas,
      Nevada for a 10-week competition against the best teams in the league.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I joined Impact as creative producer, the staff was me, the team manager, and the company's CEO. Impact signed an H1Z1 Pro League team, and
      I built a content offering that took Impact from an unknown esports org to
      one with a sizable fanbase, competing alongside the likes of Cloud 9.
    </p>
    <p>
      I developed the company's entire content strategy while managing partner
      activations, shooting and editing everything, and handling budgets and
      equipment. Fans followed the players' stories, which I told through
      editing hundreds of hours of footage, personal interviews and structured
      storytelling about their successes and failures.
    </p>
